{"id":"e5bbc43941063123","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-analytical-enumeration.md","title":"Analytical Enumeration Theorem","display":"thm-analytical-enumeration — Analytical Enumeration Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-analytical-enumeration","aliases":["68-thm-analytical-enumeration"],"display":"thm-analytical-enumeration — Analytical Enumeration Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"19.4 p.74 / PDF 83","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-route-read; real-universal-machine-implementation-not-formalized","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-analytical-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-analytical-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytical-enumeration — Analytical Enumeration Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"19.4 p.74 / PDF 83"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-route-read; real-universal-machine-implementation-not-formalized"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k\">\\(X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle\\)</span> 为末尾追加自然数索引。解析类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle)\\in Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle)\\in Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists U\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle)\\in U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists U\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle)\\in U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项对应19.4。源文把枚举对象称function，此处按正文实际的真假关系表达成Q/U。先用19.1后的正规形把数前缀压成一个与末实量词相反的数全称或数存在量词；对相应混合元数的Π⁰₁或Σ⁰₁关系取通用关系，再加n个交替实量词，得到同层级的枚举关系。源19.4的例子实际使用Π⁰₁通用关系。这里不假定存在统一枚举所有全递归二值矩阵的全递归通用矩阵；程序的通用求值允许部分定义。18节为扩展机器编码和通用函数给出路线，但当前笔记未单独完整编码该通用机器，因此陈述已与原书核对、证明路线已读，机器编号实现仍不作为本地已完成证明。这里的自然数索引仅枚举无固定外加实参数的lightface类；§20的粗体类需实数索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k$，$\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle$ 为末尾追加自然数索引。解析类见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle)\\in Q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists U\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle)\\in U).","display":true}],"bytes":2225,"backlinks":[{"id":"038e64585683402b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-enumeration]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-enumeration|thm-analytical-enumeration — Analytical Enumeration Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["4eb7f663287e8b98"]}